(1) chromatic roots of the tie-graph C_n  =?  1 + (n-1)th roots of unity (= character ratios, THM-403)
   C_5: 5 roots; |root-1|=1 (on unit circle centered at 1)? 4/5 ;  k=1 a root? True
      roots-1 (should be (n-1)th roots of unity): -1.00+0.00j, 0.00-1.00j, 0.00+0.00j, 0.00+1.00j, 1.00+0.00j
   C_6: 6 roots; |root-1|=1 (on unit circle centered at 1)? 5/6 ;  k=1 a root? True
      roots-1 (should be (n-1)th roots of unity): -1.00+0.00j, -0.31-0.95j, -0.31+0.95j, 0.00+0.00j, 0.81-0.59j, 0.81+0.59j
   C_7: 7 roots; |root-1|=1 (on unit circle centered at 1)? 6/7 ;  k=1 a root? True
      roots-1 (should be (n-1)th roots of unity): -1.00+0.00j, -0.50-0.87j, -0.50+0.87j, 0.00+0.00j, 0.50-0.87j, 0.50+0.87j, 1.00+0.00j

(2) Lee-Yang/fugacity zeros of the covering-depth Z(z)=sum p_k z^k (LRC partition function)
   (1, 2, 3, 4) (p0=0.000): Z-zeros min|Im|=0.000  zeros=['0.60-1.95j', '0.60+1.95j', '-1.53+0.00j', '0.00+0.00j']
   (1, 3, 4, 7) (p0=0.000): Z-zeros min|Im|=0.000  zeros=['0.21-2.15j', '0.21+2.15j', '-2.34+0.00j', '0.00+0.00j']
