(3) FTA duality: coeffs = combinatorial spectrum (H, independence counts); roots = char ratios.
    Newton's identities map power-sums (traces/H-moments) <-> elementary symmetric (coeffs) <-> roots.
    chromatic roots of C_n = roots of unity = the (Z/n)* witness orbit (THM-403) = character ratios.
